    "description": "You have an egg factory, and your goal is to make the chickens lay as many eggs as possible.\r\n\r\nStarting from a small factory, the eggs will be packaged and sold to earn income. Use the money to upgrade the production line. The higher the level, the faster the production speed and the higher the price. Unlock new production lines to obtain different types of eggs.",
